"┌ Favorites ─────┐┌ Messages ────────────────────────┐┌ Reading ─────────────────────────┐"
"│* adds┌Keys──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐      │"
"└──────│Tab / Shift-Tab          Next pane / previous pane                        │      │"
"┌ Unrea│Enter                    Open the folder or message, fold a date group    │      │"
"│No unr│→ ←  l h                 Unfold or fold a folder or group, next/prev mail │      │"
"└──────│*                        Add the folder to Favorites or take it out       │      │"
"┏ Folde│↑ ↓  j k                 Move, or scroll the message                      │      │"
"┃>   In│PgUp PgDn Ctrl-B Ctrl-F  Move or scroll a page                            │      │"
"┃    Se│Ctrl-U Ctrl-D            Move or scroll half a page                       │      │"
"┃    Pr│g g  G  Home End         Jump to the first or last                        │      │"
"┃      │v V, then y              Pick text or lines in the message, copy it       │      │"
"┃      │z                        Zoom the pane, or show every pane again          │      │"
"┃      │b                        Hide or show the folders                         │      │"
"┃      │Space, Ctrl-A            Mark a message, mark them all (Esc clears)       │      │"
"┃      │d                        Move marked, selected or folder to Deleted Items │      │"
"┃      │D                        Delete marked, selected or folder for good       │      │"
"┃      │c  r  R  f               Write a message, reply, reply to all, forward    │      │"
"┃      │F5  Ctrl-R               Sync every folder now                            │      │"
"┃      │/                        Search every folder (Esc goes back)              │      │"
"┃      │S                        Write this account's signature                   │      │"
"┃      │?                        Show this help                                   │      │"
"┃      │q  Ctrl-C                Quit                                             │      │"
"┗━━━━━━│                         Press any key to close                           │──────┘"
" ? help└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘q quit "
